<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-FRENCH LEAGUE CUP SEMIFINAL SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-FRENCH LEAGUE CUP SEMIFINAL SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of French League Cup</p>
<p>semifinals played on Tuesday:</p>
<p> Bordeaux     2 - Ziani 49, Diawara 96</p>
<p>Montpellier  2 - Bakayoko 62, Robert 109</p>
<p>(after extra time)</p>
<p>HT: 0-0  FT: 1-1  Att: 25,000</p>
<p>Bordeaux won 7-6 on penalties</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
<p> Strasbourg   2 - Zitelli 45, 69</p>
<p> Monaco	 1 - Anderson 60</p>
<p>HT: 1-0  Att: 20,000</p>
